{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"feel like someone is watching\" (+ paranoia anxiety hypervigilance trauma))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1106539267#16_2468525798","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q3750","rank":1,"snippet":"with you, you just might be a psychic medium! Now what? What Being a Psychic Medium Doesn’t Mean Now Chillax and Have Fun \" , \"segment\": \"This is because your vibration is so high. Sometimes, high vibrations make electronics go wacky. 13. You give amazing advice – People feel better after talking to you because you soothe them with words of wisdom. People tell you should have your own advice column. What’s this all about? Oh, you’re probably channeling the Divine and not even aware of it :) 14. You feel the presence of Spirits – You sense that there *could* be a spirit, but you’re not sure. Maybe you <cover>feel like someone is watching you, but it’s just you and Fido hanging out, snacking on popcorn and watching Game of Thrones. You may feel a sudden wave of emotion, such as sadness or anxiety </cover>associated with the presence. (\" , \"start_char\": 5476.000000 , \"title\": \"15 Signs You're a Psychic Medium - Not a Crazy Person - Intuitive Souls Blog\" , \"url\": \"https://intuitivesoulsblog.com/psychic-medium/\" }"}}
