{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_381218626#3_968987370","relevance":3,"reason":"Dedicated article on why someone feels watched; this segment directly explains the feeling as an evolved threat-detection system that can become excessive, and links it to common paranoid thoughts, ideas of reference, social inferiority, and worries about criticism or harm.","learned":"Feeling watched can arise from an evolved social threat-detection system; mild paranoid thoughts are common, while extreme versions may involve ideas of reference or hidden-threat interpretations."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"feel like someone is watching you\" (+ paranoia delusion anxiety psychosis))","reason":"Search for distinct dedicated mental-health sources using the exact lay phrasing and clinical cause terms, rather than continuing to collect mostly duplicate Bustle segments."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"feel like someone is watching you\" (+ paranoia delusion anxiety psychosis))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1106539267#17_2468527303","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3761","rank":2,"snippet":"be a psychic medium. Woo-hoo! If several of these resonate with you, you just might be a psychic medium! Now what? What Being a Psychic Medium Doesn’t Mean Now Chillax and Have Fun \" , \"segment\": \"What’s this all about? Oh, you’re probably channeling the Divine and not even aware of it :) 14. You feel the presence of Spirits – You sense that there *could* be a spirit, but you’re not sure. Maybe you <cover>feel like someone is watching you, but it’s just you and Fido hanging out, snacking on popcorn and watching Game of Thrones. You may feel a sudden wave of emotion, such as sadness or anxiety </cover>associated with the presence. ( clairsentience) 15. You felt strongly connected to someone after they passed away – For example, my aunt passed away recently. For the first week, I could feel her presence constantly. I KNEW she was around. On top of that, alarms kept going off in my house, and I was getting “signs” daily, including someone calling my house randomly asking for Janet (her name)!\" , \"start_char\": 5741.000000 , \"title\":","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1106539267#16_2468525798","rank":1,"relevance":0}]}}
